e (on Mars only); FSR coming later","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T11:47:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039442","verified_at":"2026-10-24T12:44:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4874310-1847286114034684","game_id":"steam-4874310","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.6 - Patchnotes","summary":"Version 0.6 is here!A massive update featuring a complex expedition system and a large map of Mars where you can engage in many activities is now available.Many thanks to everyone who has provided feedback so far and who has played and tested the previous versions!Patch Notes- Complete UI overhaul- Save and load system revamped; 3 profiles for different save files- Old save files should appear in Profile 1- Revamped tutorial; choice between Manager Mode and Free Mode- Revamped loading screen tha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T01:25:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034684","verified_at":"2026-10-23T03:32:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4874310-1846651706684433","game_id":"steam-4874310","kind":"update","title":"Trailer Expedition Update 0.6","summary":"On Friday, October 23, 2026, the massive Expedition Update 0.6 will be released. The demo will receive an update that will be over 20 GB in size.In this trailer, you can get a brief overview of everything there is to discover.Patch notes will follow on the day of release.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T12:05:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684433","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4874310-1842846814451711","game_id":"steam-4874310","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.6 is well on its way","summary":"A Look Ahead to UPDATE 0.6It will still be a little while before the next update arrives. But to help pass the time a bit, here are a few glimpses of what’s in store for you.In Update 0.6, you’ll have the chance to explore our Milky Way in greater detail.To that end, there will be a new station in the solar system that offers numerous new features.A major part of this will be the exploration of alien star systems.Little by little, you'll explore more and more systems, learning about their charac","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T21:54:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451711","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4874310-1840310314342296","game_id":"steam-4874310","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.5 - Patch 4","summary":"- Docking positions are now always assigned to the correct station. Manually docking after cancelling the autopilot no longer sends the ship to the previously selected destination.- Docking approaches can now be cancelled using a new button or the autopilot key.- A second autopilot route can no longer be started during docking, preventing conflicting flight states.- Station storage now supports multi-selection as well as “Store Selection” and “Store All”.- Asteroids now contain larger resource r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T15:44:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314342296","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4874310-1839676055896438","game_id":"steam-4874310","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.5 - Patch 3","summary":"- The autopilot now reliably observes the intended speed limit in the Outer Ice Ring.- Scroll lists for ship colors, notepad colors, and ship appearances now retain their position.- Tau Ceti attack charges now accumulate both online and offline up to the upgraded storage limit.- Flight Point bonuses now correctly apply to every player-controlled ship and are calculated from its equipped stats.- Cargo optimization now uses the ship’s actual equipped cargo capacity.- Fixed asteroids in the asteroi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-04T03:46:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055896438","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4874310-1839676055892538","game_id":"steam-4874310","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.5 - Patch 2","summary":"Moving black screen areas in asteroid regions have been fixed. Background effects now remain correctly visible at all times.The current objective now retains your mining progress after materials are stored or sold.Refinery and Factory completion notifications now disappear automatically when the corresponding building is opened directly.Active missions now display the combined total requirements for all required resources.Mining chances for the current area are now displayed in the HUD. The pane","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-02T12:19:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055892538","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4874310-1839676055890134","game_id":"steam-4874310","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.5 - Patch 1","summary":"This hotfix addresses several localization, display, and usability issues.Fixed:- Material names and 